   7:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****   *          functionalities of the Serial Peripheral Interface (SPI) peripheral:
   8:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_spi.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
